---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Departing from Khao Sok"
  description="Detailed guide to travellers leaving Khao Sok to Surat Thani, Phuket, Krabi Koh Samui,. Koh Phangan and Koh Lanta"
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/DSC01366.jpg"
  heroTitle="Departing from Khao Sok"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Departing From Khao Sok", "href": "/departing-from-khao-sok/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Leaving Khao Sok</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>Due to its remote location, departing Khao Sok can seem challenging. To make it easy, we have therefore prepared this post to help our guests organise their onward trip. We can also arrange private cars to deliver guests to nearly any location in southern Thailand. Below, we also provide information about public transportation from Khao Sok to Koh Samui, Khao Sok to Koh Phangan, Khao Sok to Surathani, Khao Sok to Phuket, and Khao Sok to Krabi. Please read the details below and then make a booking with reception team when you are at the resort. The final section deals with leaving directly from the lake instead of from our resort.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>Please note that all prices and times are subject to change, and should therefore be verified with reception on arrival. In addition, the prices we charge for public transportation tickets are the same as all other hotels and shops in Khao Sok. </span>
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok to Koh Samui and the Gulf Islands</span>
        </h2>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/DSC01366.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok to Koh Samui by ferry"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok to Koh Samui by ferry</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>The Gulf Islands of Koh Samui, Koh Phangan and Koh Tao are popular onward destinations from Khao Sok. While getting there can be easy and inexpensive, travels times are often long. Therefore, guests should plan to spend most of the day getting from Khao Sok to Koh Samui, Koh Phangan, or Koh Tao.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>The most inexpensive trip from Khao Sok to Koh Samui, Khao Sok to Koh Phangan and Khao Sok to Koh Tao is a joined van+ferry combo ticket. Times and prices are provided below. With this option, the cost of the shared van ticket and ferry ticket are included in one price. The journey starts with a shuttle from the resort into Khao Sok village to rendezvous with the van.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>Guests then take the shared van to Surathani bus station and board a different van for the short transfer to Don Sak pier. At Don Sak pier, guests are given a ferry ticket, and board the boat in time for departure. </span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Please note that this transfer involves a choice of 2 types of ferry: </strong>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>1. A high-speed passenger ferry (Lomprayah Ferry company), that departs from Tapee pier in Surathani town. This is your only option to Koh Tao, and also serves Koh Samui and Koh Phangan.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>2. A low-speed car ferry (Raja Ferry company or Seatran Ferry company) departing from Don Sak pier, which is a </span>one hour drive from Surathani town. These ferries <span>serve Koh Samui and Koh Phangan.</span>
        </p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok to Koh Samui and Khao Sok to Koh Phangan – Ferry</span>
        </h3>
        <div class="my-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/70 shadow-md">
          <table width="100%"><thead><tr><th align="left"><b>Depart Khao Sok</b></th><th align="left"><strong>Arrive Koh Samui</strong></th><th align="left"><strong>Price to Koh Samui</strong></th><th align="left"><strong>Arrive Koh Phangan</strong></th><th align="left"><strong>Price to Koh Phangan</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">6:30</td><td align="left">12:30</td><td align="left">770</td><td align="left">14:00</td><td align="left">870</td></tr><tr><td align="left">10:00</td><td align="left">15:30</td><td align="left">770</td><td align="left">17:00</td><td align="left">870</td></tr><tr><td align="left">13:00</td><td align="left">18:30</td><td align="left">770</td><td align="left">20:00</td><td align="left">870</td></tr></tbody></table>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok to Koh Tao, Koh Samui, and Koh Phangan – Speedboat</span>
        </h3>
        <div class="my-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/70 shadow-md">
          <table width="100%"><thead><tr><th align="left"><strong>Depart</strong><br /> <strong>Khao Sok</strong></th><th align="left"><strong>Arrive</strong><br /> <strong>Koh Samui</strong></th><th align="left"><strong>Price to</strong><br /> <strong>Koh Samui</strong></th><th align="left"><strong>Arrive</strong><br /> <strong>Koh Phangan</strong></th><th align="left"><strong>Price to</strong><br /> <strong>Koh Phangan</strong></th><th align="left"><strong>Arrive</strong><br /> <strong>Koh Tao</strong></th><th align="left"><strong>Price to</strong><br /> <strong>Koh Tao</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">06:30</td><td align="left">12:30</td><td align="left">1,050</td><td align="left">12:45</td><td align="left">1,150</td><td align="left">14:00</td><td align="left">1,400</td></tr><tr><td align="left">09:00</td><td align="left">14:00</td><td align="left">1,050</td><td align="left">14:45</td><td align="left">1,150</td><td align="left">16:00</td><td align="left">1,400</td></tr><tr><td align="left">12:00</td><td colspan="4" align="center">This boat goes to Koh Tao only</td><td align="left">18:00</td><td align="left">1,600</td></tr></tbody></table>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>For guests with a larger budget or on <a href="/khao-sok-family-holiday-thailand/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">holiday with a family</a>, we are happy to arrange a private car from Khao Sok to Koh Samui, via the Don Sak ferry pier. This will increase flexibility around departure times and will save 1-2 hours of travel time. This can be especially useful for catching the high-speed Lomprayah ferry. Guests opting to hire a car will also have the option of taking a slow ferry later in the day. For example, two ferry companies provide services to Koh Samui and Koh Phangan until 19:30 and 18:00, respectively. </span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>You can find more information on the </span><a href="https://www.rajaferryport.com/?act=p&title=sailing-schedule-donsak-koh-phangan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors"><span>Raja ferry</span></a><span> and </span><a href="https://www.seatrandiscovery.com/trip-schedules.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors"><span>SeaTran</span></a><span> websites. Guests can inquire about costs upon check-in. </span>
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok to Surat Thani</span>
        </h2>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/IMG_0461.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok to Surathani"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok to Surathani</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>Getting from Khao Sok to Surathani has never been easier. Whether taking public transportation, or hiring a private car, guests will find that this outbound transfer is easy and inexpensive. For those on a budget, there are shared vans and buses going from Khao Sok to Surathani town, airport, and train station. These run hourly, beginning at 07:00, and ending at 17:00. Ticket prices are around 150B, and travel time is as follows:</span>
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>1. Khao Sok to Surathani airport: 1.5 hours</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>2. Khao Sok to Surathani train station: 1.5 to 2 hours</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>3. Khao Sok to Surathani town: 2 to 2.5 hours</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>Additionally, guests can hire a private car from Khao Sok to Surathani locations. Travel time in a private car will be reduced by 30-45 minutes compared to public transportation. Guests can inquire about costs upon check-in.</span>
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok to Phuket</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>Getting from Khao Sok to Phuket can be challenging. For any guest going to Phuket, the easiest transfer is via a private car. This is especially true if your destination is the airport or a ferry pier, neither of which can be reached by the bus from Khao Sok. </span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>Public buses leave Khao Sok at approximately 9:30, 11:30, 13:30, and 15:30 (depart Riverside 30 minutes earlier). <em>These times are subject to change so please check with reception for details. </em>The public bus ends its service at the station in Ph</span><span>uket town. Travel time is 4 – 4.5 hours. From here, guests will need to hire a taxi or find a local bus to their destination.</span>
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/Insta-24.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok Lake boatman"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok Lake boatman</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          There are shared vans from Khao Sok to Phuket at roughly 9:00 and 14:30, but the timing changes often. The cost is between 600 and 800 Baht per person depending on the final destination.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok to Krabi</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>Guests going from Khao Sok to Krabi will find their public transportation options limited. For example, there are no public buses making this trip, only shared vans. These vans leave Khao Sok at 08:00, 12:00 and 16:00 (depart Riverside 30 minutes earlier). All transfers with vans from Khao Sok to Krabi will have an option to continue onward to Ao Nang.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <b>Please note:</b><span> only the 08:00 van from Khao Sok to Krabi is direct! This trip takes 2.5 – 3 hours. The 12:00 and 16:00 trips travel down the coast, passing through Khao Lak and Phang Nga. As a result travel time is significantly longer, and also the van is more crowded. </span><span>The afternoon vans to from Khao Sok to Krabi are not recommended, due to frequent guest complaints.</span>
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok to Koh Lanta</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>The only public transportation option to Koh Lanta is a shared van + ferry combo, leaving at Khao Sok at 06:30. </span><span>The cost is around 900B, and travel time is about 5 hours.</span><i><span> </span></i><span>Guests wishing to depart at other times of the day will need to hire a car to take them (via the new bridge) to the island. Please check with reception for transfer prices.</span>
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/THAILAND_D2417.jpg"
            alt="Cheow Larn Lake boat"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Cheow Larn Lake boat</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Cheow Larn Lake to…anywhere</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>The overnight lake trip at Cheow Larn Lake, also known as Khao Sok lake, returns to the national park pier between 13:00 and 14:00. If you are heading east to the Gulf Islands or south to Krabi after the overnight lake trip, you may find it easier to continue your journey directly from the lake instead of returning to <a href="/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Riverside Cottages</a>. Guests leaving Cheow Larn Lake will find the following options:</span>
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><b>To Surathani town:</b><span> catch a shared van or public bus from Takun. You will not arrive in Surathani town before 17:00</span></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><b>To Phuket: </b><span>catch a public bus in Takun. This will also pass through Khao Sok on the way to Phuket.</span></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><b>All other destinations: </b><span>Same-day arrival is not possible via public transportation. See below for information regarding hired cars.</span></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span><strong>* Note</strong> – Guests planning on leaving Cheow Larn Lake and traveling directly to their next location via public transport, will need to bring their luggage with them for the trip. </span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>The best method to get from <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cheow Larn Lake</a> to your next destination is via a private car. Hiring a car will allow guests to leave their large bags in Khao Sok (our driver will bring it to you). Additionally, a hired car allows guests to make the trip from Khao Sok to Koh Samui or Koh Phangan via slow ferry.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong><i>While we have tried our best to ensure that this information is accurate and up to date, we once again remind our guests that all prices and times are subject to change, and should be verified with reception on arrival!</i></strong>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Looking for additional travel information? Be sure to visit the <a href="/khao-sok-map-directions/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">directions</a> and <a href="/khao-sok-faqs/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">useful information</a> pages of our website!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Find your perfect<a href="/khao-sok-accommodation/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors"> Khao Sok accommodation</a> with us and adventure into the depths of the Khao Sok jungle!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <span>Safe travels!!</span>
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/Group-1.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok Nature resort staff"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok Nature resort staff</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
